      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 6 months ago",
      "body": "We went to a seahorse farm,the children loved it and didnt get bored they even got to touch a baby shark.Vic was a little afraid of the shark but once he saw all the other children pat it he got game and went ahead 😀\nWe then had lunch at the beach and the children played on the playground had a iceblock then it was back on the bus and home.It was a hot day 35* so the children were tired and most fell asleep on the bus it was the best part of the day lol.\nIt was his first excursion with kindy and it was also his last as next week is his last week of kindy then he starts school 😭 so i am sure there will be many school excursions in the future.",
